WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.467 --> 00:00:17.651
Theo: I can't believe it's almost spring.

2
00:00:17.652 --> 00:00:22.037
Skyler: The robins are back!

3
00:00:22.038 --> 00:00:24.940
Ben: And it's been raining for two weeks.

4
00:00:24.941 --> 00:00:27.906
Riley: I wish it would stop.

5
00:00:27.907 --> 00:00:29.588
Mrs. Summers: Oh dear.

6
00:00:29.589 --> 00:00:31.849
Riley: What's wrong, Mom?

7
00:00:31.850 --> 00:00:35.140
Mrs. Summers: The Oakdale Nursing Home flooded.

8
00:00:35.141 --> 00:00:38.378
Sarah: What's a nursing home?

9
00:00:38.379 --> 00:00:41.699
Mrs. Summers: It's a home for older people.

10
00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:45.489
Theo: My grandfather lives in a nursing home.

11
00:00:45.490 --> 00:00:48.053
Mrs. Summers: The first two floors flooded.

12
00:00:48.054 --> 00:00:52.051
Mrs. Summers: All the people are crowded on the third floor.

13
00:00:52.052 --> 00:00:54.836
Riley: Maybe we could visit them.

14
00:00:54.837 --> 00:00:59.266
Sarah: Yeah! And cheer them up.

15
00:00:59.267 --> 00:01:01.847
Chatter: Cheer up! Cheer up!

16
00:01:01.848 --> 00:01:05.132
Skyler: We could bring our pets!

17
00:01:05.133 --> 00:01:11.238
Mrs. Summers: Good idea! I'll call and see if it's okay.

18
00:01:11.239 --> 00:01:15.376
Theo: I can show them Whiskers' new trick.

19
00:01:15.377 --> 00:01:18.157
Riley: I'm going to give Snooks a bath.

20
00:01:18.158 --> 00:01:22.525
He got muddy in the rain.

21
00:01:22.526 --> 00:01:25.710
Snooks: Ar-ooo!

22
00:01:25.711 --> 00:01:28.777
Riley: Snooks hates baths.

23
00:01:28.778 --> 00:01:30.589
Chatter: Cheer up! Cheer up!

24
00:01:30.590 --> 00:01:35.043
Kids: Ha-ha!

25
00:01:35.044 --> 00:01:37.316
Mrs. Summers: I called the nursing home.

26
00:01:37.317 --> 00:01:39.812
We can go tomorrow afternoon.

27
00:01:39.813 --> 00:01:41.641
Riley: Come on, Snooks.

28
00:01:41.642 --> 00:01:44.610
Time for your bath!

29
00:01:44.611 --> 00:01:53.128
Snooks: Ar-ooo!

30
00:01:53.129 --> 00:01:55.011
Mrs. Summers: We're here.

31
00:01:55.012 --> 00:01:57.620
Is Snooks on his leash?

32
00:01:57.621 --> 00:01:59.272
Riley: Yes.

33
00:01:59.273 --> 00:02:02.404
Mrs. Summers: Skyler, please check Chatter's cage door.

34
00:02:02.405 --> 00:02:06.477
Mrs. Summers: We don't want any pets getting loose.

35
00:02:06.478 --> 00:02:10.174
Skyler: Chatter's cage door is locked.

36
00:02:10.175 --> 00:02:13.967
Theo: Whiskers and Frankie are safe in my pockets.

37
00:02:13.968 --> 00:02:18.757
Sarah: Mittens doesn't need a cage.

38
00:02:18.758 --> 00:02:22.397
Mrs. Summers: Okay, everyone. Please remember your manners.

39
00:02:22.398 --> 00:02:28.449
Mrs. Summers: And make sure your pets remember their manners too!
